:"c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"秦桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000413","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000413","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000414","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p043","text":"景公四年，晉欒書弒其君厲公。十五年，救鄭，敗晉兵於櫟。是時晉悼公為盟主。十八年，晉悼公彊，數會諸侯，率以伐秦，敗秦軍。秦軍走，晉兵追之，遂渡涇，至棫林而還。二十七年，景公如晉，與平公盟，已而背之。三十六年，楚公子圍弒其君而自立，是為靈王。景公母弟後子鍼有寵，景公母弟富，或譖之，恐誅，乃奔晉，車重千乘。晉平公曰：「后子富如此，何以自亡？」對曰：「秦公無道，畏誅，欲待其後世乃歸。」三十九年，楚靈王彊，會諸侯於申，為盟主，殺齊慶封。景公立四十年卒，子哀公立。后子復來歸秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000414","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"晉欒書","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000415","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"其君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000260","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"晉悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000261","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"晉悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000261","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000414","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m043-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"平公","kind":"person